        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ce65aa2f-b020-4b8a-9dec-36f64ff2d03f\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app after update... Just playing with emotions of people to earn money\"},{\"review_id\":\"3c874822-496a-4494-935c-dff3e6b70841\",\"review_text\":\"Super work on sweden 🫨😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"75df6b57-d874-4a74-a352-a375b379bf84\",\"review_text\":\"It became the worst app now 😭\"},{\"review_id\":\"19c5c2ab-d7bf-4d57-b65c-043f30214da6\",\"review_text\":\"Vrey good add🌼🤍\"},{\"review_id\":\"dc874ca7-4a3c-456c-8957-b5043328d536\",\"review_text\":\"They randomly removed my lyrics and won't let me skip songs I don't like cause of limited skips. I hate it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"488e0cc2-f55e-45d1-bf53-abfdf8319cd2\",\"review_text\":\"Bycottttt\"},{\"review_id\":\"9365b83d-2a62-49e3-bd99-2d688d14e6ba\",\"review_text\":\"This app is so annoying. First they took out the lyrics which is ok, its understandable like to pay premium for that thing its fine, second they took out the main thing which is going back to the specific part of the song to listen to it again and third, to play the songs in order in a Playlist like what is happening?\"},{\"review_id\":\"9ed6065c-44b4-49b6-9ef5-6af2558f0e88\",\"review_text\":\"It has all i need The playlists are fantastic\"},{\"review_id\":\"dfae7363-4287-457a-9d6c-ea152062c791\",\"review_text\":\"Cool app bat Idk how to log in bat is cool app thx 🙏❤\"},{\"review_id\":\"4543aa0c-440e-4e5e-9b84-c974a3808c41\",\"review_text\":\"PUSH the ADD too much irritating\"}]}"
